      "text": "Stable chronic illness:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " expected to last ± one yr or until death. \"Stable\" = judged against the pt's own tx goals: a pt ⍉@ goal = ⍉stable, even if the condition hasn't chged and there's ⍉short-term threat to life or funct."
     }
    ]
